WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.682 --> 00:00:04.000
- [Voiceover] You're
playing with and against

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.587
all the different people in the club.

00:00:05.587 --> 00:00:09.269
And you learn to appreciate
them because of that.

00:00:09.269 --> 00:00:10.338
It's just a little family.

00:00:10.338 --> 00:00:13.337
It's an odd little sport and it's unique.

00:00:13.337 --> 00:00:16.888
It's easy to play, but hard to master.

00:00:16.888 --> 00:00:19.638
(dramatic music)

00:00:33.977 --> 00:00:35.206
- [Voiceover] Come on.

00:00:35.206 --> 00:00:37.123
- That one's short, oh.

00:00:38.024 --> 00:00:39.462
- [Voiceover] All right, three.

00:00:39.462 --> 00:00:41.201
- Cadieux Cafe is the only
place where there's authentic

00:00:41.201 --> 00:00:44.855
Belgian feather bowling
in the United States.

00:00:44.855 --> 00:00:48.438
It's a bowling game,
that uses wooden discs

00:00:50.071 --> 00:00:52.650
that you throw at a
feather at the opposite end

00:00:52.650 --> 00:00:54.414
of the lane to try and
get close to the feather.

00:00:54.414 --> 00:00:56.222
It's similar to bocce
or horseshoes in that

00:00:56.222 --> 00:00:58.555
it's a target sport that way.

00:00:58.555 --> 00:01:02.902
The unique thing about this
one is that the lane is convex

00:01:02.902 --> 00:01:06.652
and the ball tends to
move in odd directions.

00:01:07.928 --> 00:01:11.905
You can score points by
being the closest with your

00:01:11.905 --> 00:01:16.741
color ball, closest to the
feather of the same color.

00:01:16.741 --> 00:01:19.365
Yellow touching, not touching the yellow.

00:01:19.365 --> 00:01:21.120
Some people are really good right away,

00:01:21.120 --> 00:01:23.494
other people, they've been
on the club for a while

00:01:23.494 --> 00:01:24.921
and I still don't know what
they're gonna do out there

00:01:24.921 --> 00:01:27.204
when they throw the ball.

00:01:27.204 --> 00:01:30.709
- [Voiceover] Oh, it was a
point and then it wasn't.

00:01:30.709 --> 00:01:32.063
It's down to one.

00:01:32.063 --> 00:01:35.790
- Cadieux Cafe today is a bar
and restaurant in Detroit.

00:01:35.790 --> 00:01:37.174
This neighborhood was a largely

00:01:37.174 --> 00:01:40.172
Belgian-American
neighborhood at one point.

00:01:40.172 --> 00:01:44.054
When the club started in
1933, this was a place

00:01:44.054 --> 00:01:46.565
for recent immigrants
after the war to come over

00:01:46.565 --> 00:01:49.071
and have a little taste of home.

00:01:49.071 --> 00:01:51.002
More popular than it's been,
I mean our average attendance

00:01:51.002 --> 00:01:53.091
for bowling every week has gone up

00:01:53.091 --> 00:01:55.341
the last three, four years.

00:01:56.494 --> 00:01:58.045
There’s a good group of guys here.

00:01:58.045 --> 00:02:00.980
They’re from all over, all walks of life.

00:02:00.980 --> 00:02:02.824
You sit there every week with them.

00:02:02.824 --> 00:02:05.032
You bowl with them, you bowl against them,

00:02:05.032 --> 00:02:07.199
and it's just a good time.

